@reporter 
Please follow the open issue guidelines and fill out the GitHub issue template with detailed descriptions, rather than just pasting a link. Additionally, internal links are not accessible externally, so please do not include them in GitHub issues.

For each issue, provide a clear and detailed description of the specific problem or the expected vs unexpected behavior identified during the initial triage.

@reporter 
Please refer to the https://<redacted-host>/tidbcloud/dev-guide-timeouts-in-tidb/, check the `tidb_gc_life_time`. 
It is better to check the FAQ and documents for basic usages before filing a github issues.
